      {
        "body_markdown": "For global prioritization, later residual-table work lowers the strongest surviving ordinary-RS gateway to the conditional k=1649 route through a non-antipodal [16384,17,8188]\u2082 inner code. It currently has no independent acceptance and must remain conditional.",
